{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","剑威凌迫"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","威圧の剣"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤大量的飞剑对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","飛剣を大量に召喚し、敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤大量的飞剑持续对一名敌人进行攻击，造成9次30% ATK伤害，每次附带敌人当前生命值5% + 0.5%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过自身150% + 10%的攻击力。优先选择当前生命值最高的敌人作为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","大量の飛剣を召喚して敵1体を持続的に攻撃し、30% ATKのダメージを9回与える。1回の攻撃につき、追加で敵の現在HP×5% + 0.5%のダメージを与える。追加ダメージは自身の攻撃力×150% + 10%を超えない。HPが最も高い敵を優先的に対象に選択"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":62,"end":69,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害还会附带50点生命汲取。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","このスキルでダメージを与える時のライフスティール+50"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至32% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值5.5% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","通常ダメージが32% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが敵の現在HP×5.5% + 0.5%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":37,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至34% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值6% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","通常ダメージが34% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが敵の現在HP×6% + 0.5%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至36% ATK，每次附带敌人当前生命值6.5% + 0.5%的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","通常ダメージが36% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが敵の現在HP×6.5% + 0.5%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":37,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","快意鞭打"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","悦びのムチ"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围的敌人造成伤害，命中后若敌人生命百分比较低则额外追加一次伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","扇状範囲内の敵にダメージを与え、対象のHP割合が一定値より低くなった場合、追加でダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","鞭打面前2格扇形范围的敌人，造成180% + 15% ATK伤害，若命中后敌人生命值百分比低于70%，则会立即追加一次鞭打，对面前2格扇形范围的敌人额外造成230% + 25% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","ムチを振るい、前方2マスの扇状範囲内の敵に180% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える。攻撃後、対象のHP割合が70%より低い場合、もう一度ムチを振るい、前方2マスの扇状範囲内の敵に追加で230% + 25% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":99,"end":105,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":95,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至185% + 15% ATK，追加鞭打的伤害提升至235% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","通常ダメージが185% + 15% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが235% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至190% + 15% ATK，追加鞭打的伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","通常ダメージが190% + 15% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが240% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_k